&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:15pt;"&gt;Laboratoires Théa社とTLM-003の米欧等を対象とした独占実施許諾契約を締結&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
